# Flag a person with a reason until a date (blank: the sheet's today), replacing any flag they had. Only a steward
# flags; anyone else, a blank reason or a bad date is refused (400), a person not on the sheet (404). While the
# sheet's today is on or before the until date, only a steward may open a claim of the person.
